# The snapshot of each demo on GitLab whose development cell no lifecycle
# line runs: the multi-image demos and hello-go-service, which has no GitLab
# release build. One GitLab project each under one pinned policy that
# includes the snapshot-images component alone: the demo's main and a change
# on branch development, then one pipeline the harness requests on main,
# whose child snapshots development. The trial judges the frozen plan and
# every planned image's receipt, the plan the snapshot planner makes of the
# declaration the demo's release builds its images from, overlaid native
# linux/amd64 and unsigned; a case names no image. The component probes no
# readiness. Nothing is released and the demo's gate does not run, so no
# release build, signer or lint archive is asked for
# (docs/live-campaigns.md, Snapshot). job-archive= is the component's job
# image; each producer the plan names builds in the runtime image of its
# toolchain, FORGE_CI_LIVE_JOB_IMAGE_ARCHIVE_<FAMILY>, which the campaign
# prepares from the plan: none for the container-first Cargo workspace and
# Go service, java and node for the monorepo's backend and frontend. The
# builder is the lane's, FORGE_CI_LIVE_GITLAB_IMAGE_BUILDER: unset or
# buildah, the Buildah job image on the contract's runner that permits user
# namespaces; kaniko, the kaniko job image of
# FORGE_CI_LIVE_KANIKO_JOB_IMAGE_ARCHIVE. The visibility is the run's:
# FORGE_CI_LIVE_CONSUMER_VISIBILITY unset or both runs each line public and
# private. Prepare with gitlab=<this file>. amd64 runners only for now. A
# selector reruns one line:
#
#   just campaign-lane <dir> gitlab test/live/campaigns/snapshot-gitlab.cases
#   just campaign-lane <dir> gitlab test/live/campaigns/snapshot-gitlab.cases hello-monorepo/snapshot/image-builder=buildah/visibility=public

consumer hello-cargo-workspace snapshot job-archive=@FORGE_CI_LIVE_JOB_IMAGE_ARCHIVE_RUST
consumer hello-monorepo snapshot job-archive=@FORGE_CI_LIVE_JOB_IMAGE_ARCHIVE_JAVA
consumer hello-go-service snapshot job-archive=@FORGE_CI_LIVE_JOB_IMAGE_ARCHIVE_GO
